config RTL8822EU
	tristate "Realtek 8822E USB WiFi"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	help
	  Driver for Realtek RTL8812EU and RTL8822EU USB wireless adapters.

	  The driver talks to cfg80211 directly rather than through
	  mac80211, so CFG80211 must be built in when this is built in.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called 8812eu.
